  "W": "REJECTED-AS-ARMED \u2014 W-K3a (gated-month spread recovery 0-4% vs >=30%), W-K3b (gradient FALLS: 1.47->1.27, 0.80->0.69), W-K3c (UW-2023 worsens +23.6->+23.8%), W-K3d (anti-relocation fires in 2023 and 2025), W-K4 (2 new D-4 conduct rows: 54574-2023, 2500-2025), W-K5 (C1-2024 CC_REGULAR PASS->FAIL). THE REJECTION IS THE MEASUREMENT: the whole state moves UP together in the winter event months (Dec-24 47.8->61.9 statewide with UW landing ~exact at actual 60.9; Feb-25 UW exact 87.4 vs 87.1) while the downstate-upstate spread stays <=$1.1 against $11-27 actual \u2014 an $8-13/MMBtu measured zonal gas spread produces <$1 of zonal price spread, so the winter downstate premium is PROVEN LOCATIONAL BY SOLVE (the internal west->east cutset never binds; the nyiso-122 static read confirmed at the LP). The measured monthly input is MISALIGNED to the coupled-block representation (rule 14's misalignment clause) until a locational mechanism lets the cutset bind \u2014 the re-open condition."
